        "tekst": "**In plain words**\n\nSocial stratification means a society ranks groups of people from high to low, giving some more money, power and respect. It's built into society, it passes from parents to children, it exists everywhere in different forms, people are taught it's fair, and it shapes who you feel you are. On the Titanic, your ticket class decided whether you survived."
